306
00:28:56,188 --> 00:28:57,288
Yeah, cave dwellers.

307
00:28:57,388 --> 00:28:57,888
Cave dwellers.

308
00:28:58,149 --> 00:29:01,090
Troglodytes are cave dwellers.

